          <span>BUKA WEB FITUR SEKARANG</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
